<title>BELGIUM: EU approves French EMU convergence plan.</title>
<headline>EU approves French EMU convergence plan.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's plan to bring its economy in line for the start of European monetary union was approved by European Union finance ministers on Monday, an EU source said.</p>
<p>&quot;The French plan has been approved,&quot; the source said.</p>
<p>Earlier ministers also approved Germany's plan to bring its economy into shape.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
